#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/wayfire-plugins-extra.xml:25
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to wayfire-plugins-extra"
msgstr "Introdução ao wayfire-plugins-extra"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/wayfire-plugins-extra.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The wayfire-plugins-extra package provides more plugins for <xref "
"linkend=\"wayfire\"/> that you may want or need. For example, for focus "
"follows mouse, you will need the <filename class=\"libraryfile\">follow-"
"focus</filename> plugin from this package."
msgstr ""
"O pacote wayfire-plugins-extra fornece mais plugins para <xref "
"linkend=\"wayfire\"/> que você pode querer ou precisar. Por exemplo, para "
"foco seguindo o mouse, você precisará do plugin <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">follow-focus</filename> originário desse pacote."

